    "summary": "[Eater Plague](vsdata:ability/death-guard.typhus.eater-plague) on Typhus is rewritten. In your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), this **PSYKER** may pick 1 enemy unit **visible** to it and no more than 18\" away; a **[Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative)** unit outside an **Attached unit** must be no more than 12\" away. Roll a D6:\n\n- 1: D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** to this **PSYKER**'s unit\n- 2-5: D6 mortal wounds to the enemy unit\n- 6: D3+3 mortal wounds to the enemy unit",
